The "perl-stack-return-variable" repository consists of architectural 
documentation, custom implementations, and experimental modifications 
to the Perl 5 core source code.

1. CORE PERL MODIFICATIONS
The modifications and patches to the Perl core engine files (such as 
regcomp.c, regexec.c, and regcomp.h) are free software; you can 
redistribute them and/or modify them under the same terms as Perl 5 
itself (either the Artistic License 1.0 or the GNU General Public License).

